{"skill":{"slug":"find-skills-skill","displayName":"Find Skills Skill"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1772382942282,"changelog":"- Initial release of the find-skills skill.\n- Enables searching and discovering OpenClaw skills from multiple sources including ClawHub, OpenClaw Directory, LobeHub, GitHub, and community forums.\n- Provides usage guidance, best practices, troubleshooting tips, and example search strategies.\n- Lists common skill categories and related skills for easier discovery and navigation.\n- Includes detailed recommendations for when and when not to use this skill.","changelogSource":"auto","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":3283,"sha256":"6a456ab419a1dafd427fb88bc7cebcc9bedb238a7e5ba6f1325145ada14b195a","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1763,"sha256":"5dfff5d29799ae3aae99b718ae0bd05b07bb9197d91c6a48b4528989914db588","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789094607512,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"e15855fbabf0dd6f6dcef8b26a0c93d69b6ee813e57bcdacdfbf8e3f806511f9","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/e15855fbabf0dd6f6dcef8b26a0c93d69b6ee813e57bcdacdfbf8e3f806511f9","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780085601760},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":16,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"SAFE","issueCount":10,"checkedAt":1789094607512},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a straightforward guide for finding OpenClaw skills, with a notable but disclosed supply-chain caution around unpinned npx examples.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The requested behavior is proportionate for discovering skills and includes alternate web and GitHub search paths; there is no request for credentials, broad filesystem access, or privileged environment changes.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill itself declares no required binaries and ships only Markdown, but its documentation recommends npx clawhub invocations that may fetch and run the latest npm package.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The instructions are scoped to user-directed discovery workflows, but several examples run the clawhub CLI through unpinned npx commands.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No persistence, background worker, privilege escalation, memory modification, or system-level installation behavior is present in the inspected artifact.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The artifact's stated purpose is skill discovery, and its content is limited to search sources, example search commands, categories, and installation tips.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Use this skill as a discovery checklist, but avoid copy-pasting unpinned npx commands in sensitive environments. Prefer a reviewed pinned version of the clawhub CLI or the listed website and GitHub search options when possible.","findings":"[RP1] expected: The repeated unpinned npx clawhub examples are real supply-chain hygiene concerns, but they are visible, user-directed discovery commands and not hidden or purpose-mismatched behavior.\n[T08] expected: The static finding aligns with the artifact evidence: unpinned npm execution is avoidable risk, but the artifact does not show malicious package content, deception, persistence, or exfiltration.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789094607512}}}}}